  "title": "Meet Enode Flex: the flexibility platform for energy retailers",
  "summary": "When we started Enode, we believed that connecting and optimising energy devices could meaningfully improve how the energy system works. Retailers have connected thousands of devices through Enode, but turning that potential into real flexibility has been a challenge. Flex changes that by giving teams one place to understand, shape and operate their flexible load. It’s a practical step toward using everyday devices to support a renewable grid.",
